Third-party components
----------------------

Mozilla Rhino (https://github.com/mozilla/rhino), MPL-2.0.
  The build downloads the source of upstream commit
  8527ebbf6d0b1599f819b5001af06e5dd9147013 (Rhino 1.9.1), verifies its SHA-256,
  applies the patches in rhino/patches (written for Vellum; they modify Rhino's
  core module and stay under MPL-2.0), and relocates the classes into a shadow
  package. Distributed jars carry Rhino's LICENSE, NOTICE and a SOURCE note under
  META-INF/licenses/rhino/. The patch series in this repository is the source
  form of those modifications.

Taffy layout test fixtures (https://github.com/DioxusLabs/taffy), MIT.
  engine/src/test/resources/taffy/ holds Chrome-generated layout fixtures from
  Taffy; their license is in that directory. They are test data only and are not
  shipped in any jar.

Bundled fonts (kit/src/main/resources/assets/oriel/font/), SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  Each licence is in kit/src/main/resources/META-INF/licenses/fonts/ and ships in the jar. All but
  Smiley Sans are subsets (GB2312 symbols and level-1 hanzi, Latin, punctuation,
  and the characters the kit's pages use), made by a fontTools script; the fonts
  are otherwise unchanged.
  - Fusion Pixel Font 8px and 12px, proportional, zh_hans (TakWolf,
    https://github.com/TakWolf/fusion-pixel-font, release 2026.10.25), OFL-1.1;
    it includes glyphs from Ark Pixel Font, Cubic 11, Galmuri, Boutique Bitmap
    7x7 (OFL-1.1), Misaki (free licence) and Miseki Bitmap (OFL-1.1).
  - Cubic 11 (ACh-K, https://github.com/ACh-K/Cubic-11, v1.500), OFL-1.1.
  - Noto Sans SC (Google, https://github.com/google/fonts, ofl/notosanssc),
    instanced at weight 400, OFL-1.1 (Reserved Font Name "Source", not used).
  - LXGW WenKai Regular (LXGW, https://github.com/lxgw/LxgwWenKai, v1.530),
    OFL-1.1. Its Reserved Font Names are not used for the subset, which is
    renamed "Oriel Kai" (oriel_kai.ttf).
  - Smiley Sans Oblique (atelierAnchor, https://github.com/atelier-anchor/smiley-sans,
    v2.0.1), OFL-1.1, the original file unmodified.
  - ZCOOL KuaiLe (https://github.com/googlefonts/zcool-kuaile, via google/fonts),
    OFL-1.1.
  - Ma Shan Zheng (https://github.com/googlefonts/mashanzheng, via google/fonts),
    OFL-1.1.
